WEBVTT

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:26.750
<i>New days, it's the morning we begin. 
Let's give the world a kiss.</i>

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:35.240
<i>Blowing in the wind, with a little 
courage and love in our pockets.</i>

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:44.090
<i>I wish: If only I had wings,</i>

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:53.690
<i>I could fly over the sadness, 
the past, and my doubts.</i>

00:00:53.690 --> 00:01:02.450
<i>Oh, yeah! There's nothing to lose. 
(Take whatever the brand new day brings.)</i>

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:07.290
<i>Take my way! I wanna catch a miracle...</i>

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:11.030
<i>in the palm of my hand!</i>

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:19.720
<i>We're off on a journey through the endless 
earth, the skies, and the future.</i>

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:32.140
<i>I know these newborn wings, oh! 
Are gonna gonna gonna shine someday!</i>

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:37.400
How horrible...

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:40.700
The demon that destroyed 
the capital has come back.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.290
You're wrong, Colette.

00:01:42.290 --> 00:01:44.350
That is one of God's messengers.

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:47.830
Please, let me confess my sins to you...

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:48.870
Cardinal Hogue?

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:51.340
Pacifica?

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:52.340
Pacifica?!

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:59.800
"Symphony of the Protectors"

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:13.150
Looks like you're having some trouble.

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:14.110
Follow my lead, Senes!

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:16.040
Pacifica's been stabbed!

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:17.110
We don't have a second to lose!

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:18.070
She's what?!

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:31.000
Crap!

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:33.040
Let's take cover by those rocks!

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:34.210
There they are!

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:42.720
You'll die if you get stung, 
so be careful, okay?

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:43.850
Who are you?

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:45.720
The introductions can wait.

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:48.310
It looks like we should get 
away from here while we can.

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:50.230
How're you doing?

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:52.350
We're holding our own!

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:55.440
Fafal!

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:56.900
Rebel scum!

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.530
Don't let up! Continue firing!

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:10.920
I don't understand...

00:03:11.470 --> 00:03:13.920
Why won't the bleeding stop?

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:16.510
Somebody! Somebody help her!

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:17.090
Somebody!

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:27.510
God...

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:30.980
Divine Mauser...

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:32.980
Please, forgive Pacifica!

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.440
Forgive Pacifica!

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:43.910
Pacifica... Pacifica...

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:43.910
Shannon! Calm down, Shannon!

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.860
You can't destroy them with one shot!

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:49.540
What are you aiming at?

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:54.080
Is that all you have?

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:57.040
I'm going to kill you...

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:01.470
Pacifica?

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:03.260
Pacifica!

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:06.970
Raquel...

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.480
Where'd big brother go?

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:26.820
No!

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:29.300
Why?

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.790
Why?!

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:48.200
I couldn't do anything to save her...

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:50.900
I couldn't do anything to save her.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:14.870
What's that?

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:19.840
What the hell?

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:24.800
Pacifica?

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:25.760
Pacifica!

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:27.220
Pacifica!

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.410
What the...? What's going on?!

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:52.450
I don't know.

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:55.950
It looks like the six of us have 
been thrown clear of the atmosphere.

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:58.560
The sealed world has gone 
into autistic mode...

00:05:58.560 --> 00:05:59.710
But why?

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.630
This is an unanticipated situation.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.460
I am unable to make contact 
with the system, either.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:07.670
By our authority, we will temporarily 
lift the restrictions on our powers.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:13.180
What the hell are <i>those</i>?

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:14.570
Drake! Ruth!

00:06:14.570 --> 00:06:15.850
Put everything you've got 
into covering Shannon!

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:16.390
Yes, ma'am!

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:21.810
Zefy! Give me everything you have!

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:22.470
Understood.

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:23.980
Do it!

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:01.020
Ruth!

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:03.150
Ruth? Ruth!

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:03.980
I can still fight!

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:04.980
Now.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:06.670
Wait, Socom.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:28.170
Damn it!

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:31.010
I sorry...

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:39.560
Cz!

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:50.440
You dumb bitch...

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.390
Shannon...

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:04.150
Raquel...

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:26.560
Is this... heaven?

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:29.860
This is a virtual reality 
location that's been created

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:33.550
within the free space of the 
sealed world's control system.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:41.620
You've left the vessel of your physical 
body and entered this system.

00:08:42.030 --> 00:08:43.850
What the heck are you doing here?

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:45.330
Are you dead, too?!

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.470
More to the point, who <i>are </i>you?!

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:50.460
Me? My name is Celia.

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:52.800
Celia Mauser.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.260
Mauser?

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:58.760
Hey, Shannon, are you all right?

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:00.210
What about Pacifica?!

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:01.810
What happened to the sealed world?

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:04.730
Its functions are locked up for some reason.

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:07.990
My links to Natalie are still cut off.

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.320
Are you... God?

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:22.660
Me? I'm a traitor.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:26.290
I'm the world's administrator, 
the one who locked away humanity.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:28.660
I...

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:33.400
You were born for the sole 
purpose of destroying me.

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:37.050
The power within you to destroy me,

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:39.970
which has built up within you 
over the past sixteen years,

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:43.470
was designed to be activated 
at the moment of your death.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:48.190
Huh? What do you mean, 
"The moment of my death"?

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:52.980
However, that seems to have happened ten 
hours short of your power reaching its peak.

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:58.200
At this moment, your powers and 
mine are in precise equilibrium,

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:02.950
and the slightest nudge could cause the 
balance to shift in either direction.

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:06.910
That is why I want you to decide.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:16.550
Long before you were born, 
there was a terrible war.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:21.970
The war dragged on and 
on, and many people died.

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:28.310
It was then that I received 
a message from the enemy.

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:33.440
They wanted me to supply them with 
information on humanity's forces

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:37.280
so they could end the war 
and preserve the human race.

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:40.490
From their point of view,

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:43.740
humanity was a rare, precious life form.

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:48.160
They were trying to find a 
way to allow humanity to live

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:50.030
when they seemed bent on self-destruction.

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:54.640
I did as they asked.

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:57.710
Because I thought that 
if something wasn't done,

00:10:57.710 --> 00:11:00.020
I would eventually lose 
even my brother and sister.

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:05.430
After that, humanity was locked 
away in their sealed world,

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:09.310
and I was implanted into the system's core.

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:13.770
I have tended this miniature 
garden for 5,000 years.

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:27.080
My younger brother and sister.

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:32.580
All I wanted was for the 
two of them to survive.

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:37.030
Even if humanity was locked away,

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:40.270
it was enough for me if 
the two of them survived.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:43.970
But it was too late...

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:49.850
Zefy, please. I want you to survive.

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:52.820
Lord Becknam!

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:56.190
The enemy has our tactical patterns!

00:11:56.190 --> 00:12:02.150
Zefiris! Gloria! Natalie! All surviving 
units, retreat into phase space!

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:09.410
I wanted the two of them to survive...

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:13.510
That is all I wanted.

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:19.420
This is your physical body.

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:25.930
The vessel that you have 
inhabited for 140,150 hours.

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.520
I want you to decide.

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:33.230
Decide what?

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:37.810
Decide whether this world 
should continue as it is.

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:42.190
I am no longer certain.

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:47.410
All this stuff about humanity 
and the world, I'm just not...

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:49.720
Just tell me what your heart tells you.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:54.600
Was what I did wrong?

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.670
Let me think...

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:06.300
I think I understand what you did.

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:10.070
I have a brother and sister, too.

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:14.740
If there was something that 
I could do to keep them safe,

00:13:14.740 --> 00:13:17.960
I think I would do it, no matter what it was.

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:24.330
Even if that took thousands 
or tens of thousands of years.

00:13:26.100 --> 00:13:32.160
But even if people could live safely 
inside that closed-off world,

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:34.500
I think there would still 
be something wrong about it.

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:38.370
Even if someone chooses the wrong path,

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:41.280
it was something that they chose themselves,

00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:44.550
and it means that you're free 
to make your own decisions.

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:48.430
I think a world where you 
can't choose for yourself...

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:51.240
is just wrong.

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.060
I suppose it is.

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:58.520
Does that answer your question?

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:00.060
Thank you.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:03.580
Now I can be set free.

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:06.030
Set free?

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:10.280
Hey, wait! I'm sorry, I take it back!

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.620
It's all right.

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:15.040
Now I can finally join my brother and sister.

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.250
Celia...

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:21.710
Goodbye, Pacifica Cassul.

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.880
Hear me, mankind.

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:12.930
I am Mauser.

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:18.000
Sheathe your swords and 
withdraw your soldiers.

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:22.650
The seed of destruction has passed you by.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:30.400
The terrible poison will 
never again wreak its havoc.

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:34.370
The doors have been opened.

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:37.650
Mankind,

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:47.580
I return to you your freedom, 
new lands, and the true sky.

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:53.790
There will be no more revelations.

00:15:56.100 --> 00:16:01.850
From now on, you will walk hand 
in hand on your own two feet.

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:06.690
Mauser is not in the heavens above you,

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:10.220
but rather within your own hearts.

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:17.320
Now you yourselves will 
weave your own future.

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:28.170
Big brother...

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:31.260
Pacifica...

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:41.560
Pervert! Pervert! Pervert!

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:43.060
Pervert!

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:47.120
You little twerp! Seeing 
you naked is no big deal!

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:49.770
You should be able to look right at me, then!

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:50.980
See, you can't look at me!

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:52.690
You closet perv!

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:55.450
How about some embarrassment instead of 
getting mad, you shameless princess?!

00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:57.660
How dare you call me that, you pedophile?!

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:00.080
Who are you calling a pedophile, 
you exhibitionist?!

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:12.300
Look! His wound!

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:30.150
Um... I'm back.

00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:00.760
I...

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:03.350
Come...

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:07.130
Please stand up, Prince Forsyth.

00:18:17.810 --> 00:18:18.820
General.

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:46.540
Are we stopping by the Cassuls' house?

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:47.770
They say they'll come later.

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:50.560
Miss Pacifica!

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:53.230
Miss Pacifica?

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:55.190
Miss Pacifica!

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:56.990
Miss Pacifica,

00:18:56.990 --> 00:19:00.200
Prince Forsyth's coronation 
ceremony is tomorrow!

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:02.740
Princess Senes and her people are waiting.

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:05.890
And the Bairachs left for 
the capital long ago.

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:10.040
Dragunov's in labor! I can't 
leave her at a time like this!

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:11.120
Yes, but...

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:14.620
Tell Forsyth I'll come to his next one, okay?

00:19:14.620 --> 00:19:16.000
<i>Next </i>one?

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:18.210
Hey, what's the holdup out there?!

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:19.970
Hurry with those supplies!

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:22.140
Sure, I'll be right there!

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.720
Hurry up, Pacifica.

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:25.430
I know, I know!

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:27.720
Okay, let's see here...

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:36.720
Miss Pacifica... Are you happy now?

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:41.150
I guess so...

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:43.910
It's peaceful, and every day is lots of fun.

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:46.150
It's not all wine and roses, but still...

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:50.410
But it's not like I need to decide 
that right now, though, right?

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:53.880
Maybe what matters

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:58.960
is that when you're on your deathbed, 
you can think to yourself,

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:00.820
"You know, maybe my life wasn't half bad."

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:06.800
I'm glad I was born the Scrapped Princess.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.850
I had to go through lots of painful stuff,

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:13.270
but I went to all kinds of places 
and met all sorts of people.

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:16.920
And if I wasn't the Scrapped Princess,

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:19.190
I never would have met you, Leo.

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:25.830
That.

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:30.910
It always keeps me safe.

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:40.550
Miss Pacifica... I'm going 
to ask you one more time.

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:44.790
Please do me the honor of marrying me.

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:01.440
Ouch.

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:04.650
You are so out of your league, you loser!

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:09.370
Please! Wait!

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:13.540
I really do love you, Miss Pacifica! Honest!

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:39.540
<i>A blessing of rain falls quietly. (Falls.)</i>

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:44.860
<i>Droplets of my love, 
which fall for someone...</i>

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:52.040
<i>who is still waiting in a land far away.</i>

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:57.830
<i>The morning wind blows, caressing 
my cheek. (What was that...)</i>

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:02.960
<i>Did you feel something, feel something 
just now? (...on my cheek?)</i>

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:06.130
<i>It goes up to the one and only sky... 
(More certain than anything.)</i>

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:11.180
<i>a sky which has a fixed, certain meaning.</i>

00:22:11.180 --> 00:22:17.730
<i>I come to a stop in the shadow 
of clouds that chase after me.</i>

00:22:17.730 --> 00:22:21.190
<i>This journey of the heart 
that I wish to gaze upon...</i>

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:24.400
<i>goes on forever and goes on forever.</i>

00:22:24.400 --> 00:22:31.030
<i>One day I will chance upon the 
voice I've not heard in so long.</i>

00:22:31.030 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>Alainn la-li-la.</i>

00:22:32.990 --> 00:22:37.710
<i>At last the ship sets sail, sets sail. 
(The ship glides on forever...)</i>

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:43.000
<i>Yes, believe in this wide world... 
(...to the edge of seas unknown.)</i>

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:46.340
<i>and go off into the distance.</i>

00:22:46.340 --> 00:22:50.440
<i>And onwards into the future.</i>
